  "question": {
    "text": "<p>The lines represented by the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>3</mn><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>, are</p>\r",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
