      "text": "inclined at <math><msup><mrow><mn>45</mn></mrow><mrow><mi>o</mi></mrow></msup></math> to each other",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "VjDf5",
      "text": "None of these",
      "image": null,
